/-! # Tensor-core arithmetic and TC-EFT

Import `TensorCore` for the first-principles numerical foundation, tensor-core model,
reference EFT, and bounded execution proofs. Smaller imports are available through
`TensorCore.Numerics`, `TensorCore.TC`, `TensorCore.EFT`, and `TensorCore.Kernels.EFT`.

Worked Lean files live in `examples/`; regression modules live in the separate
`TensorCoreTests` library under `tests/`. Start with `docs/guide/01-getting-started.md`.
